@nawl_music
"Glimmer and fade" 
This podcast is an interpretation of the alteration of time unique to the Vallée Électrique festival. Here, hours stretch out. The mind navigates between subaqueous immersion and shared waves. Captivated by the collective energy, the listener refuses to tune out, until collapsing from exhaustion. The mind then finds peace, in the wake of the last glimmer, like a candle going out.
